        type: 'about',
        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Mort (La Morte)',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Mort (also known as La Morte) is a specialized trick-taking card game for 3 to 5 players, traditionally played with a modified Tarot deck. Created by Matt Haller, it combines the structural depth of Bridge and Tarot with a unique 'Specialist' mechanic centered around the 'La Morte' card (the 13 of Trumps). It involves complex bidding, the ability to 'Drop Out' of a hand to avoid points, and a high penalty for being 'Fuori dal Tempo' (out of time) on the final trick.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Designed by Matt Haller as a modern homage to historical Italian Tarot games like Tarocchini, but with simplified bidding and scoring meant for faster play.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '3-5 (rules vary by count).',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '37 cards (A, K, Q, Cav, J, 10, 9, 8, 7) + 13 of Trumps (La Morte).',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '37 cards (A, K, Q, Cav, J, 10, 9, 8, 7) + 13 of Trumps (La Morte).',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Each player receives 9 cards. The 'Talon' determines the trump suit.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'Five players: Play with 9 extra cards (two extra ranks per suit) plus Il Bagatto (1 of Trumps), highest Club. Ranks from high: Il Bagatto, A K Q C J 10 9 8 7 6 5.',
                  },
                  {
                    text: 'Standard 52-card pack: International 52-card pack: 3–4 players have A K Q J 10 9 8 7 6; 5 players also have 5 and 4. Joker or unused Spade as La Morte; 2 of Clubs as Il Bagatto if needed.',
                  },
                  {
                    text: 'Muck when all drop: If all players drop out, dealer may muck the deal (round abandoned, deal passes left) instead of restarting with a bid.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
