          deck: '37 cards (A, K, Q, Cav, J, 10, 9, 8, 7) + 13 of Trumps (La Morte).',
          equipment: '',
          dealing: "Each player receives 9 cards. The 'Talon' determines the trump suit.",
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Total the most points through contracts and trick-captures.',
          gameplay: 'Each round is 9 tricks. Players must play in the lead suit if possible; otherwise any card may be played. The highest trump in the trick wins, or if no trump was played, the highest card of the led suit wins. The trick winner leads the next trick. La Morte is played as if in the trump suit: players may never lead La Morte unless it is their only card. La Morte wins any trick when trump was led; if led off-trump it loses and the taker becomes Il Morto (scores for that trick but plays no more tricks; lead passes left).',
          keyRules: [
            'Dealer deals 9 cards each; talon sets trump (or no trump if La Morte is talon).',
            'Bid 1 to 9 tricks or all; Accept sets contract; Drop Out aims for 0 tricks.',
            'Follow suit. Highest trump or highest led-suit card wins. La Morte plays as trump; do not lead it unless only card.',
            'Maker makes bid: score contract value; maker fails: each defender scores contract value. Dropper with 0 tricks: contract minus 1; otherwise 0. Each trick worth 1 to maker and defenders. Fuori dal Tempo (lead La Morte on last trick): 0. Revoke: deduct points earned.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Avoid leading La Morte! Since it loses if led off-trump, it is a defensive card. Use it to kill an opponent's high trump lead. If you are the contract maker, your goal is to draw out the opponents' trumps before they can use La Morte against your high side-suit cards.",
          intermediate: "The 'Drop Out' Risk: If you have a terrible hand, choice 'Drop Out' in the bidding. Your goal is 0 tricks. This is safer than bidding 1 and failing, as it guarantees you 'Defense' points if the contract maker fails.",
          advanced: "Timing the Death: Use 'La Morte' to make an opponent 'Il Morto' when they are the strongest. By forcing them to win a non-trump trick with your La Morte, you remove their high cards from the remaining tricks, effectively handing the game to yourself or your partner.",
          tips: [
            "Keep track of the 9 tricks. If you have La Morte, make sure you have at least one other card to lead on the 9th trick to avoid 'Fuori dal Tempo'.",
            "In a 5-player game, 'Il Bagatto' is the highest Club. Treat it like a second 'Super-Trump'.",
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
